Derivation: the character-sheet modules (sheet_spec.py, sheet_layout.py,
sheet_store.py, sheet_routes.py, sheet_pass_core.py, planner.py, the in-node panel
under web/js/ and their tests) were originally written inside
ComfyUI-MiniMax-H3-Motion-Director, which is itself distributed under GPL-3.0 and
contains portions derived from ComfyUI_MiniMaxH3_Director (Apache-2.0, AIMixer) and
ComfyUI-H3-Motion-Context (GPL-3.0, NikoDemon80). They are carried here unchanged in
substance; this pack does not import that project at runtime and does not depend on
it being installed.

Rendering uses ComfyUI's own MiniMax H3 implementation
(comfy_extras/nodes_minimax_h3.py).
